				},
				{
					"id": 710800623,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}為塔列辛講述了此前的經歷…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710800624
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710800624,
					"content": "有趣…這個實在令人意想不到呀…請容我好好構思一下再開口吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710800625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塔列辛"
				},
				{
					"id": 710800625,
					"content": "「…雖是高可參天的巨蘑，面臨黑暗侵襲之時，亦是難以自救的弱者…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710800626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塔列辛"
				},
				{
					"id": 710800626,
					"content": "#「…{NICKNAME}應呼喚而來，為其淨化土地，排憂解難…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "塔列辛"
